    example: "- CodeBuild pushes an image tagged with the commit SHA, then reads the digest back from ECR into build.json\n- The test stage records which digest it ran against; the gate blocks a rebuilt image even though the commit matches\n- A task definition pins the digest, sets 512 CPU units and 1 GB of memory, and fetches DATABASE_URL through the secrets block\n- A deploy fails its health check, ECS keeps the previous tasks serving traffic, and the circuit breaker rolls back automatically\n- An ECR lifecycle policy expires untagged images after 14 days, cutting registry storage by two thirds",
